<title>BELGIUM: BBL buys stake in Indonesian Bank Mashill.</title>
<headline>BBL buys stake in Indonesian Bank Mashill.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Banque Bruxelles Lambert (BBL) said on Friday it would buy a 10 percent stake in leading Indonesian private bank  Bank Mashill to consolidate a strategic agreement between the two banks.  </p>
<p>Djakarta-based Bank Mashill has a network of 35 agencies in the seven biggest cities of Indonesia, which has a total population of about 200 million.</p>
<p>Bank Mashill, which has a total workforce of 1,000, has a balance sheet total of about 24 billion Belgian francs, BBL said.</p>
<p>BBL itself has been operating a representative office in Jakarta since 1985.</p>
<p>-- Bert Lauwers, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
